* func_call -- drives a counter through 1000 program-defined function calls.
* bottleneck: program-defined function call and return overhead.
        DEFINE('inc(n)')                                :(inc_end)
inc     inc = n + 1                                     :(RETURN)
inc_end count = 0
        i = 1
loop    count = inc(count)
        i = LT(i, 1000) i + 1                           :S(loop)
        OUTPUT = '1000 chained calls = ' count
END
